@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title State lifecycle — Idea status

[*] --> Logged : Capture (L2-014 criterion 1)
Logged --> Critiquing : automatic, first non-empty critique notes saved (L2-014 criterion 6)
Logged --> Curating : automatic, curated (L2-014 criterion 7)
Critiquing --> Curating : automatic, curated (L2-014 criterion 7)
Curating --> Building : manual (L2-052)
Building --> Built : manual (L2-052)
Logged --> Building : manual (L2-052)
Logged --> Built : manual (L2-052)
Critiquing --> Building : manual (L2-052)
Critiquing --> Built : manual (L2-052)
Curating --> Built : manual (L2-052)
Built --> Building : manual (L2-052)

note right of Curating
  Automatic rules never move
  Curating, Building or Built
  to an earlier status (L2-014 criterion 8)
end note
@enduml
